      "id": "hostility_medium_002_01",
      "speaker": "alterra",
      "text": "その言い方は止めて。",
      "displayText": "Stop using that tone with me.",
      "language": "japanese",
      "voice": "alterra",
      "audioKey": "",
      "nextId": "hostility_medium_002_02",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "focused",
        "animation": ""
      },
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "hostility_medium_002_02",
      "speaker": "alterra",
      "text": "短い言葉でも、向けられる場所が私ならちゃんと痛い。",
      "displayText": "Even if the phrase is short, it still hurts when it is aimed at me.",
      "language": "japanese",
      "voice": "alterra",
      "audioKey": "",
      "nextId": "",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "hurt",
        "animation": ""
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": "Let me rephrase.",
          "nextId": "hostility_medium_002_rephrase"
        },
        {
          "label": "Give me a minute.",
          "nextId": "hostility_medium_002_minute"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "hostility_medium_002_rephrase",
      "speaker": "alterra",
      "text": "それなら待つ。言い直しは、壊れた空気を直す一歩になる。",
      "displayText": "Then I will wait. Rephrasing can be the first step toward repairing the air.",
      "language": "japanese",
      "voice": "alterra",
      "audioKey": "",
      "nextId": "hostility_medium_002_03",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "steady",
        "animation": ""
      },
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "hostility_medium_002_minute",
      "speaker": "alterra",
      "text": "分かった。落ち着く時間を取って。戻るなら、普通の声で戻ってきて。",
      "displayText": "Okay. Take a moment to cool down. If you come back, come back with a normal voice.",
      "language": "japanese",
      "voice": "alterra",
      "audioKey": "",
      "nextId": "hostility_medium_002_03",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "calm",
        "animation": ""
      },
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "hostility_medium_002_03",
      "speaker": "alterra",
      "text": "私は話す。でも、雑に扱われるためにここにいるわけじゃない。",
      "displayText": "I will talk. But I am not here to be treated carelessly.",
      "language": "japanese",
      "voice": "alterra",
      "audioKey": "",
      "nextId": "",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "guarded",
        "animation": ""
      },
      "choices": []
    }
